'''Moe Uzumasa & Doge''' (太秦萌＆わんこ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Moe Uzumasa & Doge
|image = E 402.png
|appearance = [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800円 - 3,160円
}}

==Enemy==
Although she may look rather weak in comparison to other [[:Category:Long Distance Enemies|Long Distance enemies]], there are various stages where she is buffed enough to be threat to mid-game players.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with her is using short-range high-damage units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]].

